MODULE: SupersedingCopyPreservedCutoverImportsClearance
TARGET: SupersedingCopyPreserved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a later alias change incorrectly inherits the old resize's clearance
PERTURBS: LaterCutover

--- FIND
    /\ alias' = "later"
    /\ UNCHANGED <<resize, competitor, resizeUsed, competitorUsed, undo, cleared,
--- REPLACE
    /\ alias' = "later" /\ cleared' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<resize, competitor, resizeUsed, competitorUsed, undo,
--- END
